The $\\textit{International Unit per Milliliter}$ is a unit for  'Serum Or Plasma Level' expressed as $IU/mL$.\r
The magnitude of one $IU/L$ depends on the material, so there is no single conversion multiplier.\r
"""^^qudt:LatexString ;
